      "id": "pgjson-004",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
      "knowledgePoint": "不存在的字段",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "PostgreSQL 17 的 JSON 字段提取运算符遇到不存在的键时通常返回什么？",
      "answer": "返回 SQL NULL，而不是因缺少该键报错。",
      "explanation": "输入结构不匹配或数组下标不存在时，提取运算符也返回 NULL。",
      "example": "'{\"a\":1}'::jsonb -> 'missing' 返回 SQL NULL。",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
        "不存在的字段"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.postgresql.org/docs/17/functions-json.html"
