    {
      "id": "pgjson-005",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "实践",
      "subtopic": "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
      "knowledgePoint": "数组下标",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "PostgreSQL 17 的 JSON 数组提取运算符怎样解释整数下标？",
      "answer": "从 0 开始编号；负数从数组末尾倒数。",
      "explanation": "这与 PostgreSQL 普通数组的常见下标习惯不同。",
      "example": "'[10,20]'::jsonb -> -1 取得 20。",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
        "数组下标"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.postgresql.org/docs/17/functions-json.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "pgjson-006",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
      "knowledgePoint": "结构包含",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "PostgreSQL 17 的 jsonb @> 运算符检查什么？",
      "answer": "检查左侧 JSONB 值是否包含右侧结构和内容。",
      "explanation": "嵌套对象要匹配对应结构，不能把内部键当成顶层键。",
      "example": "'{\"a\":1,\"b\":2}'::jsonb @> '{\"b\":2}'::jsonb 为真。",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
        "结构包含"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.postgresql.org/docs/17/datatype-json.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "pgjson-007",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
      "knowledgePoint": "数组包含语义",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "PostgreSQL 17 的 jsonb 数组包含判断中，元素顺序和重复元素重要吗？",
      "answer": "在 @> 的数组包含比较中，元素顺序无关，重复元素按一次处理。",
      "explanation": "该规则是包含运算的语义，不表示数组本身丢失顺序。",
      "example": "'[1,2,3]'::jsonb @> '[2,1,1]'::jsonb 为真。",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
        "数组包含语义"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.postgresql.org/docs/17/datatype-json.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "pgjson-008",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
      "knowledgePoint": "顶层存在",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "PostgreSQL 17 的 jsonb ? 运算符会递归查找嵌套对象中的键吗？",
      "answer": "不会；它检查顶层对象键或顶层数组中的字符串元素。",
      "explanation": "可以先提取子对象，再对该子对象使用 ?。",
      "example": "'{\"a\":{\"b\":1}}'::jsonb ? 'b' 为假。",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
        "顶层存在"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.postgresql.org/docs/17/datatype-json.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "pgjson-009",
