      "subtopic": "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
      "knowledgePoint": "GIN 操作类",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "PostgreSQL 17 的 jsonb_path_ops GIN 索引能否支持 ? 键存在运算符？",
      "answer": "不能；它支持 @>、@? 和 @@，默认 jsonb_ops 还支持键存在运算符。",
      "explanation": "选择操作类应结合查询运算符；索引支持不保证规划器一定使用。",
      "example": "需要 ? 查询的列可考虑默认 jsonb_ops GIN 索引。",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL JSON 数据",
        "GIN 操作类"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.postgresql.org/docs/17/datatype-json.html"
